gDShIt8PB5YQ7kNvwFE1rZA&_nc_oc=AdoETYhKcV1vb9XU-l2dS41m5TqBLeswYf4D8f-bT7gTNdNQVUCvtdeAcZC8A9sHAPs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR6M9Qm2jOWwg4CM2BJ0d8XnlBx7dyyB94D0r2d6E_UNw&oe=6AF47837"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ivYyTYbD_0EQ7kNvwEQPEFg&_nc_oc=AdrfEKKVNwtSxQzrJxv5_hMkQRicAtMMs4hzG5MGe6YhnB6NHHXbZT2JSiDWQSVqzN8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQAAa0U6V0_9i4DQ9DrkIPAI92YNG_WkyDLw6tqdfSY1w&oe=6AF479CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2T2dfW18mrgQ7kNvwGqSKtA&_nc_oc=AdoxH5B8wArX3xbMCSYeGTwkeDMHW7ffBbllm_I1AzN47A82n0Hd7jV2yHVFWYj9Uy8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSPJW56U7Bh16J2jOd8XT74z1Glq_jf3v148zYZBHuClw&oe=6AF49F2F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h7S6MA_eY2oQ7kNvwFs4Pga&_nc_oc=AdrQbtD_C7n7cw4XKHcwdpAw4h8BbssHxGsA51gjY95wG65ppuFGxqVrAnCRTIFs8p8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT0235PX8u3eXws_nwlF7k9mtGj8qyYD6CMYZY3nmmIaA&oe=6AF48883"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vh01-EitBHYQ7kNvwFEofCI&_nc_oc=AdpsbkV3OkIlwV8HO0IyXNqfnn8_KErPVVR9JvOGjh_lLaFFAXTHwFvw2ayUyUqPRUU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ0Y-ZVViS6H__9eZgXkg_ijrgazji8B2SygcUXRIJjrw&oe=6AF480D8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EHCIizgM7ygQ7kNvwEqG_O7&_nc_oc=AdqGOZWJJ6ramqm5DNz6B7AdjXuBzacM_qVA5EZd82OEj7JRcBEnoU54_1AYbuP-Z_0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ3Ehe9_4uFOiunDf8VxiTUtlLPPf9OacDuXfszp6g1iw&oe=6AF493FC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080